  {
   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Microsoft.ServiceBus api-version 2026-01-01 swagger. Every other official operation of this api-version returns HTTP 501 NotImplemented. Namespace and queue metadata only: no endpoint, message, session, topic, authorization rule, SAS key or connection string exists; message counts stay 0. Queue forwarding must name another existing queue in the same namespace; partitioning cannot change after creation. Deleting a namespace deletes its queues; every other operation is not implemented (HTTP 501).",
